+/*
+ * How far the display probe got, printed by the heartbeat below. The probe cannot write the UART itself: the
+ * kernel console owns it, and two writers at 1.5 Mbaud truncate each other's lines (evidence/m5/M5-04). One
+ * writer, the heartbeat, prints the stage the probe has reached. Zero and "none" mean the probe never ran.
